hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-14 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-14 = cons "**The schema is outside the data.** An OWL ontology, a SHACL shape or a property-graph schema sits apart from the" (cons "instances it governs. It is written in a different language, evolves on a different cadence, and doesn't" (cons "constrain itself. Changing a schema means migrating data by procedures the graph doesn't contain." (cons "" nil)))
